	(text_box "Tying VDSTH to > 3V disables monitoring. Internal pull-down is 450k. Pull up with 150k from 5V --> 3.75V(VDD LDO is disabled with nSTBY, so use 5V to prevent faults).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 76.7732 0)
		(size 41.91 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
